00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.060
Trop cool !

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.970
- Parfait. - Ouais.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.180
Bon allé, je vais me coucher.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.080
- Bonne nuit. - Bonne nuit.

